%%{init: {"theme": "neutral", "flowchart": {"wrappingWidth": 400}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant R as R session
  participant F as Job folder
  participant S as Slurm
  participant T as Array tasks

  R->>F: write inputs and scripts
  R->>S: sbatch 01-bash.sh
  S-->>R: job ID (4242)
  R->>F: save job.rds
  par Slurm runs the array
    S->>T: start tasks 1 and 2
    T->>F: read own chunk, FUN, ...
    T->>T: mclapply(X, FUN)
    T->>F: write 03-answer-N.rds
    S->>F: write 02-output-4242-N.out
  and R waits
    loop until all tasks have ended
      R->>S: status?
      S-->>R: PENDING, RUNNING, ...
    end
  end
  R->>F: Slurm_collect(): read answers
  R->>R: combine into one list
  R->>F: Slurm_clean(): delete folder
